(14, 'Ultimate Wedding Car Decoration Guide 2026: Traditional Om Designs to Luxury Floral Drapes', 'wedding-car-decoration-guide-traditional-luxury-floral', 'Make your wedding day journey as unforgettable as your vows with our professional wedding car decoration services. Whether you desire a contemporary luxury look or a traditional cultural aesthetic, our bespoke floral arrangements ensure your bridal vehicle makes a stunning statement.

Our featured designs include vibrant centerpieces of red and yellow gerbera daisies mixed with fresh white lilies, accented by elegant pink, blue, or magenta net drapes. For a traditional and spiritual touch, we specialize in custom floral Om symbols and V-shaped garlands meticulously crafted from fresh marigolds and roses. From delicate hand-placed red roses on the car hood to intricate rooftop floral crowns and sweeping S-curve arrangements, our decorations are tailored to complement luxury vehicles like Jaguar, Toyota, and Kia. Let us help you create a romantic and breathtaking ride for your first journey as a married couple.', 'img_69a3ff871771c_WhatsAppImage20260226at42747PM.webp', 1, '2026-03-01 08:57:43', 'Wedding Car Decoration 2026 | Custom Floral & Traditional Designs', 'Elevate your wedding with premium car decorations. We offer custom floral garlands, traditional marigold Om designs, and luxury rose accents for a grand entrance.', 'wedding car decoration, bridal car flowers, traditional marriage car decor, floral Om car design, luxury vehicle floral styling, fresh rose car decoration, gerbera daisy car centerpiece, wedding car drapes, marigold car garlands, 2026 wedding trends', NULL),
(15, 'Personalized Wedding Car Decor: Floral Initials and Heart Arrangements for Your Big Day', 'personalized-wedding-car-floral-initials-heart-decor', 'Add a deeply personal touch to your wedding transportation with our custom floral initials and heart car arrangements. Our expert florists specialize in creating bespoke designs using fresh white chrysanthemums, yellow roses, and vibrant red blooms to craft your initials—like the featured "S & P" design—directly onto your vehicle. These personalized elements are framed by a lush floral heart border and accented with delicate baby''s breath. Whether you are decorating a luxury sedan or a classic getaway car, our custom bridal car lettering ensures your wedding vehicle is as unique as your love story.', 'img_69a40010aebda_WhatsAppImage20260228at123505PM1.webp', 1, '2026-03-01 09:00:00', 'Custom Floral Wedding Car Initials | Romantic Heart Car Decor', 'Personalize your wedding car with fresh floral initials and heart-shaped arrangements. Bespoke bridal car decor featuring roses, carnations, and custom lettering.', 'wedding car initials, floral car heart, personalized bridal car decor, custom wedding car lettering, fresh flower car initials, romantic wedding car styling, bespoke floral car arrangements, initials made of flowers', NULL),
(16, 'Personalized Wedding Car Decor 2026: Floral Initials and Heart Arrangements', 'personalized-wedding-car-floral-initials-heart-decor-1', 'Add a deeply personal touch to your celebration with our custom wedding car floral lettering. Our expert florists specialize in creating bespoke designs using fresh white chrysanthemums, yellow roses, and vibrant red blooms to craft your initials—like the featured "S & P" design—directly onto your vehicle. These personalized elements are framed by a lush floral heart border and accented with delicate baby''s breath for a romantic finish.

In addition to modern lettering, we offer traditional and spiritual motifs, including custom floral Om symbols meticulously crafted from fresh marigolds and red carnations. From bold heart-shaped hood displays to intricate V-shaped garlands and net drapes on luxury sedans, our bespoke bridal car decor ensures your getaway vehicle is as unique as your love story.', 'img_69a400df81096_WhatsAppImage20260226at42745PM.webp', 1, '2026-03-01 09:03:27', 'Custom Floral Wedding Car Initials | Romantic Heart Car Decor', 'Personalize your wedding car with fresh floral initials and heart-shaped arrangements. Bespoke bridal car decor featuring roses, traditional Om designs, and custom lettering.', 'wedding car initials, floral car heart, personalized bridal car decor, custom wedding car lettering, fresh flower car initials, romantic wedding car styling, bespoke floral car arrangements, initials made of flowers, floral Om car design, 2026 wedding car trends.', NULL),
(17, 'Personalized Wedding Car Floral Initials & Heart Decor: 2026 Trend Guide', 'personalized-wedding-car-floral-initials-heart-decor-2', 'Make your wedding day truly unique with our personalized wedding car floral decor. We specialize in bespoke floral typography, using fresh white chrysanthemums and yellow roses to craft custom initials—like the stunning "S & P" featured in our latest work. These personalized letters are nestled within a hand-crafted floral heart arrangement composed of vibrant red roses and delicate baby''s breath.

