The Occasions That Need Same Day Delivery the Most
Birthdays are the obvious one, but living in Delhi means navigating a constant cycle of occasions. A colleague''s farewell announced that morning. A relative''s housewarming you forgot was today. A friend going through something difficult who needs a gesture more than a plan. A romantic moment you want to create without the formality of a scheduled delivery.
