The delivery executive will call the recipient. If unreachable, they may leave the bouquet with a neighbour, security guard, or reattempt delivery later. Communicate any availability constraints when placing your order.', '', 1, '2026-07-09 11:32:10', 'Same-Day Flower Delivery in GK Delhi', 'Need same-day flower delivery in GK? Get fresh bouquets delivered to Greater Kailash within hours. Order before noon for guaranteed same-day service.', 'same day flower delivery GK, GK flower delivery today, Greater Kailash same day flowers, urgent flower delivery GK, quick flower delivery Delhi, GK bouquet delivery, fast flowers GK', NULL);

