(26, ',5,11,17,', 'Grand Red Rose Bouquet in Layered Black & White Signature Wrap', 'grand-red-rose-bouquet-in-layered-black-white-signature-wrap', 2899.00, 3799.00, 'Make a bold statement of love with our Grand Red Rose Bouquet. This stunning arrangement features a dense cluster of premium, hand-selected red roses, symbolizing deep passion and admiration. The roses are encased in a dramatic, multi-layered black wrap with sharp white piping, creating a modern, high-fashion aesthetic. Finished with the signature gold \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Sun Flower\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" logo, this bouquet is designed for those moments that require a truly grand gesture.', 'uploads/flowers/699f0d0a0f2e2_1772031242.jpg', NULL, 1, 1, 'Grand Red Rose Bouquet - Luxury Black & White Wrap  New delhi', 'Discover the ultimate romantic gesture with our Grand Red Rose Bouquet. Featuring premium roses in a striking layered black and white signature wrap.', 'grand red rose bouquet, luxury roses, black and white flower wrapping, large rose arrangement, premium floral gifts, Sun Flower, romantic flower delivery', '2026-02-25 14:54:02', 5.0, 1, 1, ',redroses,rose,sameday,', NULL, NULL, 'Premium romantic red rose bouquet for anniversary and same-day delivery'),
(27, ',12,5,', 'Red Rose Petals and Baby’s Breath (Gypsophila)', 'red-rose-petals-and-babys-breath-gypsophila', 4999.00, 8499.00, 'Elevate your wedding ceremony with this exquisitely handcrafted Red Rose Petal and Baby’s Breath Garland. Designed for the modern couple who appreciates traditional elegance, this Varmala features densely packed, velvety red rose petals contrasted beautifully by the ethereal, cloud-like texture of fresh white Baby’s Breath.​Design: Alternating bands of rich crimson petals and delicate white blooms.
​Symbolism: Represents the perfect union of passion (red roses) and everlasting purity (baby''s breath).
​Occasion: Ideal for Jaimala ceremonies, wedding receptions, and high-profile floral celebrations.
​Comfort: Lightweight and flexible, ensuring ease of wear throughout long rituals.', 'uploads/flowers/69a0261441be9_1772103188.jpg', NULL, 1, 1, 'Red Rose Petal & Baby’s Breath Wedding Garland | Traditional Jaimala', 'Shop our premium Red Rose Petal and Baby’s Breath Varmala. A stunning handcrafted floral garland for Indian weddings, combining deep red rose borders with white Gypsophila.', 'red rose jaimala, baby''s breath varmala, wedding flower garland, indian wedding flowers, designer rose petal mala, fresh flower varmala online', '2026-02-26 10:53:08', 4.8, 1, 1, ',jaimala,varmala,', NULL, NULL, 'Handcrafted red rose petal and baby''s breath wedding garland, designed by a premium flower shop near me.'),
(28, ',13,5,', 'Sai Flower’s Exquisite Jasmine & Fuchsia Rose Fresh Floral Jewellery Set - Pre-Wedding Haldi & Mehendi Edition (Delhi Delivery)', 'sai-flowers-exquisite-jasmine-fuchsia-rose-fresh-floral-jewellery-set-pre-wedding-haldi-mehendi-edition-delhi-delivery', 2499.00, 3299.00, 'Embrace the vibrant traditions of Delhi with Sai Flower''s breathtaking, entirely fresh floral jewelry adornment set. This is not just a gift, it''s a memory woven in fresh blooms by our master florists in Delhi.

Product Details & Composition:

This bespoke set, curated by our expert team at your premium flower shop near me, features:

A central Maang Tikka (head ornament): Featuring long, delicately strung fresh white Jasmine (Mogra) bud chains that lead to a striking, central fuchsia-pink rose bloom. This central rose is enveloped in a delicate cluster of tiny white filler flowers, creating a truly luxurious look.

Two matching hair accessories (pins or clips): Perfectly co-ordinated, each side piece mirrors the main bloom with its vibrant fuchsia rose and a shorter elegant string of fresh Jasmine buds, allowing for versatile styling in the hair.

Perfect for Occasions:

Designed primarily to add a touch of nature’s elegance to Delhi’s most beautiful pre-wedding rituals like Haldi, Mehendi, and Sangeet. However, its unique charm makes it a stunning choice for special birthday surprises for her, unique anniversary gifts, a romantic expression of love, or even as a special Diwali gifting option.

Unmatched Freshness & Delivery:

At Sai Flower, we pride ourselves on the freshness of every bloom. Each piece is crafted just before dispatch by a skilled Delhi florist. We ensure this freshness reaches you with our efficient online flower delivery across Delhi. Whether you need a last-minute surprise or a meticulously planned arrival, take advantage of our convenient same-day delivery service. For an even more magical surprise, we also offer midnight flower delivery in Delhi.

Why Choose Sai Flower:

100% Fresh Flowers: We only use the freshest, hand-picked blooms.

Expertly Handcrafted: Every piece is meticulously crafted by our expert local florists in Delhi.

Unique Designs: Our premium floral jewelry is unlike generic artificial sets, offering true natural beauty.

Premium Presentation: Delivered in a premium bouquet-style (well, ''set-style'') presentation.

Order this unique bouquet delivery (of a special kind!) in Delhi today and experience the difference of a truly luxury flower shop near me. Dazzle with the scent of fresh Jasmine and the vibrant color of premium roses.', 'uploads/flowers/69a0263db55ae_1772103229.jpg', NULL, 1, 1, 'Exquisite Fresh Jasmine & Rose Flower Jewellery Set | Delhi Best Florist', 'Order handcrafted fresh Jasmine & Fuchsia Rose floral jewelry for Delhi Haldi/Mehendi. Unmatched freshness & intricate design. Same-day & midnight delivery from Sai Flower.', 'flower, flowers, florist, florist in Delhi, flower shop near me, online flower delivery Delhi, fresh flower jewelry, floral jewelry set, jasmine flower jewelry, rose flower jewelry, wedding flower jewelry, bridal flower jewelry, haldi mehendi flowers, Sai', '2026-02-26 10:53:49', 5.0, 1, 1, ',flowerjewellery,', NULL, NULL, 'Fresh jasmine and fuchsia rose floral jewelry set for weddings, handcrafted by our premium flower shop.'),
(29, ',12,5,', 'SaiFlower Pure Blessings Premium Varmala Pair: Hand-crafted Red Roses & White Jasmine Garlands for Delhi Weddings', 'saiflower-pure-blessings-premium-varmala-pair-hand-crafted-red-roses-white-jasmine-garlands-for-delhi-weddings', 3599.00, 5499.00, 'Welcome to the World of SaiFlower: At SaiFlower, we understand that traditional ceremonies are more than just events; they are moments of deep, spiritual connection and love. Our Premium Varmala Pair is not just a floral arrangement; it is a meticulously crafted masterpiece of traditional artistry, designed to elevate your special day. Each bud is hand-selected from the finest gardens across Delhi-NCR, ensuring an unmatched premium look and fragrance.

The Eternal Bond of Roses & Jasmine: Hand-threaded with dense, perfectly formed clusters of fresh-picked white jasmine buds (Chamelon) and vibrant, deep-crimson red roses, these garlands symbolize purity, passion, and evergreen love. Our master florist in Delhi ensures that every pair is a perfect vision, meticulously balancing the textures. The elegant tassel finish, with cascading jasmine buds and rich rose accents, adds a final, luxurious flourish to this sacred adornment.

Occasions for Divine Adornment: While designed to be the spectacular centerpiece for traditional Wedding Varmala exchange ceremonies, this pair can also be adapted. Use it as a magnificent Phoolon ki Ka-Chadar for a bridal entrance, or as an extraordinary, premium offering for significant festivals like Diwali. It is also a spectacular, heartfelt gift to surprise a couple on their wedding anniversary or to decorate your home for a special religious gathering.

Why SaiFlower for Varmala in Delhi?

Ultimate Freshness Guarantee: We source and craft your garlands on the day of delivery, ensuring the freshest, most fragrant flowers.

Master Florist Craftsmanship: Each piece is hand-made to order by an expert florist who specializes in traditional designs.

Same-Day Delivery & Midnight Magic: Need it fast? We offer prompt same-day flower delivery across Delhi-NCR. Want a surprise? Our premium midnight delivery service ensures your flowers arrive at the stroke of twelve for a memorable start to a celebration.

The Trusted Delhi Florist: When you search for a "flower shop near me" in Delhi, choose SaiFlower for quality that transcends. We are dedicated to providing the ultimate premium experience, from selection to delivery, right here in Delhi.

Order your SaiFlower Premium Varmala Pair today and make your sacred moments truly unforgettable.', 'uploads/flowers/69a027d32d5c2_1772103635.jpg', NULL, 1, 1, 'Varmala Delhi: Premium Red Rose & White Jasmine Garlands - SaiFlower', 'Bless your wedding with our divine Varmala pair from SaiFlower Delhi. Hand-crafted with freshest red roses and jasmine. Order now for premium same-day or midnight delivery!', 'flower, flowers, florist, bouquet, Delhi florist, flower shop near me, online flower delivery Delhi, Varmala, Varmala pair Delhi, red rose garland, jasmine garland, wedding garlands Delhi, traditional flowers Delhi, premium florist Delhi, Phoolon ki Ka-Ch', '2026-02-26 11:00:35', 4.9, 1, 1, ',jaimala,varmala,', NULL, NULL, 'Fresh crimson red roses and white jasmine varmala pair for Delhi weddings by SaiFlower, a premium flower shop near me.'),
(30, ',9,', 'Exclusive Red Rose Wedding Car Decoration in Delhi | Luxury Floral Décor by SaiFlower', 'exclusive-red-rose-wedding-car-decoration-in-delhi-luxury-floral-dcor-by-saiflower', 5999.00, 7999.00, 'Your love story deserves a cinematic arrival. At SaiFlower, we transform ordinary vehicles into stunning chariots of romance with our premium wedding car decoration services. Designed to turn heads and capture hearts, this exclusive floral arrangement is crafted to make your first journey together absolutely magical.

The Decoration Style
Inspired by the timeless elegance of royal Indian weddings, this setup features a breathtaking bonnet centerpiece bursting with fresh red roses, vibrant seasonal blooms, and lush green foliage, all delicately draped with premium pink netting. To complete the luxurious look, individual fresh red roses are meticulously styled along the side doors and panels, creating a sweeping, romantic aesthetic against the backdrop of your car. Every flower is hand-selected by our master florists to ensure maximum freshness, vibrancy, and fragrance.

Perfect for Every Romantic Occasion
Whether you are planning a grand bride or groom arrival, this versatile and elegant design is perfect for life''s most precious milestones:

Weddings & Receptions: Ensure the newlyweds arrive in unmatched style.

Surprise Anniversaries: Whisk your partner away in a vehicle blooming with love.

